{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02495","headline":"冬日宴于庶子宅各赋一字得节 · 杜正伦","name":"冬日宴于庶子宅各赋一字得节","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"李门余妄进，徐榻君恒设。\n清论畅玄言，雅琴飞白雪。\n寒云暧落景，朔风凄暮节。\n方欣投辖情，且驻当归别。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜正伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02495.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02495","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}